     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<br><br><div><br><div><b>(A)</b> 以下是我的資料結構(表一)，主要想做的事是把資料畫成heatmap呈現，並標示出各編碼分組（範例如圖一）<br><b><br></b><div><b>表一：</b><br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"382\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:286pt\">\r\n\r\n <colgroup><col width=\"135\" style=\"width:101pt\">\r\n <col width=\"73\" style=\"width:55pt\">\r\n <col width=\"87\" span=\"2\" style=\"width:65pt\">\r\n </colgroup><tbody><tr height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"20\" width=\"135\" style=\"height:15.0pt;width:101pt\">Name</td>\r\n  <td width=\"73\" style=\"width:55pt\">Set</td>\r\n  <td width=\"87\" style=\"width:65pt\">type</td>\r\n  <td width=\"87\" style=\"width:65pt\">value</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">NN0042</td>\r\n  <td>Ir</td>\r\n  <td>MS</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">43.5325</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">NN0222</td>\r\n  <td>Ir</td>\r\n  <td>MS</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">1295.87</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">NN0402</td>\r\n  <td>Ir</td>\r\n  <td>MS</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">528.093</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">NN0582</td>\r\n  <td>Ir</td>\r\n  <td>MS</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">36.4206</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">NN0762</td>\r\n  <td>Ir</td>\r\n  <td>CC</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">176.403</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">NN0942</td>\r\n  <td>Ir</td>\r\n  <td>CC</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">157.521</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">NN1122</td>\r\n  <td>Ir</td>\r\n  <td>CC</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">22.3884</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">NN1302</td>\r\n  <td>Ir</td>\r\n  <td>CC</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">45.747</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">NN1482</td>\r\n  <td>Ir</td>\r\n  <td>CC</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">11.739</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">NN1662</td>\r\n  <td>Ir</td>\r\n  <td>CC</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">14134</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">NN1842</td>\r\n  <td>Ir</td>\r\n  <td>HJ</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">53.4089</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">NN2022</td>\r\n  <td>Ir</td>\r\n  <td>HJ</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">43.0488</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">NN2202</td>\r\n  <td>Ir</td>\r\n  <td>HJ</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">301.511</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">NN2382</td>\r\n  <td>Ir</td>\r\n  <td>HJ</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">402.65</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">NN2562</td>\r\n  <td>Ir</td>\r\n  <td>HJ</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">3.20055</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">NN2742</td>\r\n  <td>Ir</td>\r\n  <td>HJ</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">4012.65</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n\r\n</tbody></table><br><div><b>圖一：</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/taiwanruser/attach/10b47b0184950/%E8%9E%A2%E5%B9%95%E5%BF%AB%E7%85%A7%202019-08-03%20%E4%B8%8A%E5%8D%8812.25.20.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"螢幕快照 2019-08-03 上午12.25.20.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"222\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\">(圖源：<a href=\"https://www.datanovia.com/en/lessons/heatmap-in-r-static-and-interactive-visualization/#pretty-heat-maps-pheatmap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.datanovia.com/en/lessons/heatmap-in-r-static-and-interactive-visualization/%23pretty-heat-maps-pheatmap&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237289036000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0YtWULP-KxzZzGaE9U6EOZ\"> DataNovia</a>)</p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">以下是heatmap主體我的程式內容，已可正確執行，問題在於增加<b>分群註解 (eg, type:MS/CC/HJ)</b>的部分，參考了一些教學（<a href=\"https://jokergoo.github.io/ComplexHeatmap-reference/book/heatmap-annotations.html#multiple-annotations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://jokergoo.github.io/ComplexHeatmap-reference/book/heatmap-annotations.html%23multiple-annotations&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237289036000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1xbMOZ7x_KJRBc2ZnRbp1E\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.datanovia.com/en/lessons/heatmap-in-r-static-and-interactive-visualization/#pretty-heat-maps-pheatmap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.datanovia.com/en/lessons/heatmap-in-r-static-and-interactive-visualization/%23pretty-heat-maps-pheatmap&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237289036000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0YtWULP-KxzZzGaE9U6EOZ\">2</a>, <a href=\"http://smonti.bumc.bu.edu/~montilab/zoho/CBMRtoolsWeb/web/heatmap.ggplot2.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://smonti.bumc.bu.edu/~montilab/zoho/CBMRtoolsWeb/web/heatmap.ggplot2.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237289036000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Ow_lBsqGPj3uwD0nTPXK5\">3</a>, <a href=\"http://nmf.r-forge.r-project.org/aheatmap.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://nmf.r-forge.r-project.org/aheatmap.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237289036000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0yafS_TFjrVaq_m3bAd25N\">4</a>, <a href=\"https://davetang.org/muse/2018/05/15/making-a-heatmap-in-r-with-the-pheatmap-package/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://davetang.org/muse/2018/05/15/making-a-heatmap-in-r-with-the-pheatmap-package/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237289036000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3NfdF_AcxsClScJM9Pp2YD\">5</a>），但因為對教學上的指令有些不理解，所以仍不太清楚該如何做，所以想向大家請教這部分可以如何做。</p><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">ggplot(tmp.exp, aes(x = Set, y = Name, fill = value)) + geom_tile()+coord_equal(ratio = 0.4)+</span> scale_fill_gradient2(low = &quot;blue&quot;,high = &quot;red&quot;, midpoint = 0, mid= &quot;white&quot;)</div></span></div></code></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><b>(B)</b> 另一部分是最近剛開始學習使用R呈現資料分析的結果，大概因為沒有R語言基本結構的理解，所以有些教學及Package的使用說明文檔看得有點吃力，想請教大家若想加強對R語言基本結構的認識及進階應用是否有中文或英文推薦書單？<br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><b>任何意見皆萬分感激<br></b></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><div><b><br></b></div><div><b><br></b></div></div></div></div></div>"
    ]
